msgctxt "badend3:badend3_99892610_1DF8_4619_982C_10B67EF1C9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, I’ll probably forget it too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My name, who I am, everything that’s "
"happened to us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫大概不久后，⟪k:1⟫我也会忘了一切吧。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫和我的名字一起……⟪k:4⟫把我们之间发生过的所有事，"
"全都忘却。"

